OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FMost places
OL,6,Fdry with evening sunshine followed by
OL,7,Fclear spells overnight. However,
OL,8,Fpatches of low cloud and some hill fog
OL,9,Freforming by the morning, giving the
OL,10,Fodd spot of drizzle.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FWednesday looks rather
OL,13,Fcloudy with the odd spot of drizzle
OL,14,Fover inland hills. Southern and
OL,15,Feastern areas seeing the best of the
OL,16,Fbrighter breaks. Showers arriving from
OL,17,Fthe northwest later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
