OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FA
OL,6,Ffresher day on Thursday with sunny
OL,7,Fspells and a few showers. Breezy on
OL,8,FFriday with isolated showers still
OL,9,Fpossible, though mostly fine on
OL,10,FSaturday with plenty of sunshine.
